  unitName: Ardent Soul Feng
  unitId: 810507
  unitNumber: 8268
  description: At the break of dawn, when the sky burnt red like fire, the child
    of Fei and Fang was born. She was named Feng, after the mythical fire bird that
    soars through the skies, becoming the sun that brings forth the light of day.
    Like her mother, Feng was wild, fierce, and independent. There was no telling
    what mischief she would get herself into the moment her parents took their eyes
    off her. Once, she was dragged back home by the village authorities for beating
    up a group of boys who teased her a little too much. Despite her temperament,
    Feng also had a much softer side. She would spend hours alone playing in the
    forest. Even as a child, Feng already had a connection with nature other humans
    could only dream to have. Animals seem to gather around the child as if she was
    a part of them, and the plants around her seemed to glow, as if calling out to
    her. There are times when Fei and Fang would find their daughter silently staring
    into the horizon. They knew that their baby girl would one day grow up and leave
    to find her own path.
  summonDesc: Who said girls are weak?<br>Hehe! Take that! And that!<br>Bow before
    the mighty Feng<br>of Krung-go!
  fusionDesc: Eat silently, speak softly...<br>Walk slowly, sit properly... Gosh!<br>What
    am I? A princess?
  evoDesc: 
